### Criar um Novo Grupo de Consórcio
POST http://localhost:8080/grupos/criar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Consorico com autodeploy na rede",
  "valorCota": 200.00,
  "vagasMaximas": 100,
  "duracaoMeses": 50,
  "enderecoContrato": "",
  "aceitaLances": true,
  "tipoLanceAdicional": "LIVRE"
}
### Criar um novo usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
"nome": "Andre Barbosa",
"email": "andrezin@email.com",
  "senhaLimpa": "132fddfsdf9fh",
"taxId": "843.456.789-10",
"carteiraWeb3": "0x90F8bf6A479f320ead074411a4B0e7944EAE8629",
  "countryCode": "BR"
}

###cria outro
POST http://localhost:8080/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Bob Souza",
  "email": "bob@email.com",
  "senhaLimpa": "30dfsf9d",
  "taxId": "987.654.321-11",
  "carteiraWeb3": "0x8888bB67C8901234567890abcdef1234567890bb",
